                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Marugame Seimen seems to thrive no matter which department store it\u0027s in. While many department stores offer a variety of food, none offer the same level of value as Marugame. The portions are just right, the food is delicious, and it\u0027s affordable. Tables turn over quickly, so you don\u0027t have to wait too long.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "丸龜製麵感覺不管開在哪間百貨\n每家生意都好好\n雖然百貨很多美食可是沒有像丸龜這樣CP值高\n份量剛剛好、好吃、平價，翻桌快速又不用等太久",
